        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>) v. supr. <i><span class="en">
				11.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. γωνία</span>
			<i>right</i> angle, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				55b
			</span></i> ; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ.</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1098a30
			</span></i>, al.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρθιος</span>
			v.
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμνειν πρὸς ὀρθάς</span> to
