				85b5
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθὸς κῶνος,
			κύλινδρος,</span> a <i>right</i> cone, cylinder, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Sph.Cyl.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.11
			</span></i>. </div>
